# Build context for the course site ONLY.
#
# BuildKit prefers `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` over the root
# `.dockerignore`, which is what makes this possible: the root file
# excludes `docs/` and `*.md` on purpose, because the dev image is 5-6 GB
# and that context is copied on every build of it. The site image needs
# exactly those files and almost nothing else, so it gets its own rules
# rather than relaxing the dev image's.
*
!docs
!course
!VERSION
!scripts/build_site.py
# Lessons name Make targets; the build checks each one exists.
!Makefile
